  (text "USB-C power only: the phone supplies 5 V because of the 5.1k pull-downs on CC1/CC2. D+/D- are not on this receptacle." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e9687db0-93a8-5f69-af1f-69fc6761f311"))
  (text "Click: S8050 switches the passive buzzer from VBUS. D2 catches the coil kick." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6c8191db-2226-513c-ae6a-a8141aa4d347"))
  (text "R6 keeps the buzzer off while the MCU resets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 106.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f3ffb5fc-80a5-5bbf-bc26-0f2b3af83e90"))
  (text "White reverse-mount LED shines through a hole in the board (camera mode). About 12 mA from PA5." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 172.72 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cc200038-cd83-50b9-89e0-e14307b06901"))
  (text "Two reverse-gullwing phototransistors look through holes in the board (display mode)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 147.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ceb8a4dd-6bce-55c6-8b6f-6024b46fca47"))
  (text "COMP2 compares SENS_A (PA3, +) with SENS_B (PA2, -). The ADC reads the same pins for dark/light." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 180.34 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d3122d8f-b3dc-53ad-a862-126c9897601a"))
  (text "Programming pads on the flat bottom side: VMCU, GND, SWDIO, SWCLK, NRST (pogo jig)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 91.44 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cbdc16ef-60b7-5629-8c6d-81bfd945f0bb"))
  (text "PY32 runs from 5 V directly (VCC 1.7-5.5 V, abs max 6.25 V). R3/C2 filter VBUS spikes." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0b7035d4-574a-5e72-a883-ccf6c423b4e6"))
